<%#
  The Camera Groups card (#1653): every camera group name iRaceDeck remembers
  from the sessions it has seen, with the tracks whose current camera file has
  it, when it was last seen, and a Remove per name.

  Settings-window only: Remove sends `cameraCatalogRemove`, handled by the
  settings-window command handler, and a Property Inspector's `sendToPlugin`
  goes to its own action instead — the same reason voice-packs.ejs is gated.
  The window passes the flag to THIS include explicitly.
%>
<% if (locals.settingsWindow) { %>
<ird-camera-catalog-list catalog="_cameraCatalog"></ird-camera-catalog-list>
<div class="ird-supporting-text ird-supporting-text-full">
  Camera Controls offers these names for Change Camera and Cycle Camera, so a key can be set up away from the track. iRaceDeck records them from each session's camera file. A name you remove comes back the next time a track whose camera file has it is loaded. Removing a name never changes a key.
</div>
<% } %>
